  "employmentType": "Full-time",
  "excerpt": "Job Description To design, code, test, debug, and maintain programs in development environments. Apply agreed standards and tools, to achieve a well-engineers result. Work within a strict framework of programming standards under supervision of senior technical resources. Murex is a global fintech leader in trading, risk management and processing solutions for Capital Markets.",
